# Security headers for nazbyte.com (Cloudflare Pages reads this file at deploy time)
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# VERIFIED against the actual pages in this repo on 2026-10-03:
#   - every page has inline <script> and inline <style> blocks  -> 'unsafe-inline' is required
#   - inline style="" attributes are present                    -> 'unsafe-inline' for style-src
#   - the ONLY external network destination is script.google.com (the tester feedback form
#     POSTs to the Apps Script endpoint with fetch())
#   - blob: is used by the image compressor for previews/downloads
#   - no external fonts, no CDNs, no analytics, no third-party scripts
#
# HSTS IS SET HERE (as an origin response header) rather than via the zone toggle, so that it is
# version-controlled with the site and reproducible. IMPORTANT: do NOT also enable the dashboard
# toggle (SSL/TLS -> Edge Certificates -> HSTS) - two HSTS headers would be malformed and browsers
# reject them. Pick one place; this is it. `preload` is deliberately omitted: it is a near-permanent
# commitment, and it can be added later once the domain has been stable for a while.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), autoplay=(), camera=(), display-capture=(), encrypted-media=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), midi=(), payment=(), picture-in-picture=(), publickey-credentials-get=(), screen-wake-lock=(), usb=(), xr-spatial-tracking=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://script.google.com; frame-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://script.google.com; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

# Admin/tester pages: keep them out of search engines at the header level too,
# independent of the meta robots tag inside the file.
/feedback.html
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive

/feedback
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
